        "title": "Novinky: We've had a baby!",
        "text": "Čerstvou novinku, která je důležitá teď, řeknete anglicky časem present perfect: have nebo has a tvar slovesa jako had, got. We've had a baby! (Narodilo se nám miminko!) My son has got married. (Můj syn se oženil.) Česky stačí minulý čas. Když ale řeknete kdy, použijte i anglicky minulý čas: We had a baby last week. Na dobrou novinku odpovězte Congratulations!",
        "examples": [
          { "target": "We've had a baby!", "native": "Narodilo se nám miminko!" },
          { "target": "My granddaughter has got married.", "native": "Moje vnučka se vdala." },
          { "target": "Congratulations!", "native": "Gratuluji!" },
          { "target": "Thank you for the invitation.", "native": "Děkuji za pozvání." }
        ],
        "reviewed": false
